{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id106873865"}, "name":{"label":"The eliminator 345"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-12T06:10:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13006831264"}, "title":{"label":"Love the game just one thing I wish would be added"}, "content":{"label":"I love this game. I have about 200 hours of gameplay, but I have one problem - the greenhouse is too small. I think you should be able to upgrade it like you upgrade the farmhouse. Other than that, great game! \n\nP.S. I also want to be able to visit Zuzu city.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id181686771"}, "name":{"label":"Souptonuts"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-11T16:11:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"13004659061"}, "title":{"label":"Crashes a lot and you lose whole days."}, "content":{"label":"I would call it a great game if it didn’t freeze when I change regions. When it freezes, the only thing you can do is log out, and then when you log back in, it starts at the beginning of whatever day you were on, and you lose anything that happened that day. That is a lot of work to lose, especially at the end of a day. I won’t play it anymore, it’s too frustrating.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
