{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1607450496"}, "name":{"label":"F-ice/doj"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-07T18:09:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12989160652"}, "title":{"label":"If possible"}, "content":{"label":"If you can, PLEASE ADD CO-OP TO MOBILE PLAYERS and give them the chance to play co-op with PC because my sisters are able to play co-op together since they are on PC, meanwhile I, who prefer mobile, am always never allowed to play games like this and have always wanted to. It's sad because I have always wanted to play with them besides Roblox, but that just gets boring. Do you plan on releasing co-op on mobile that can do crossover with PC? If you can, I would be grateful for that.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"6"}}, 
