{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1488149799"}, "name":{"label":"✌️Rarely✨reviews✌️"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-25T07:27:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12934961605"}, "title":{"label":"My favorite game! Just one change idea"}, "content":{"label":"This is one of my favorite games, I highly recommend it for those who need something to do. There is so much content and you can easily play this game for hours! There is just one thing I would like for the developers to consider. You can only have/adopt a child if you are married, but what if you don’t want to be? I think a good solution would be to be able to adopt a child as soon as you get a nursery,regardless of relationship status. However, I understand this may take away from the marriage feature, so a good way to keep this separate would be to make single adoption only a 3% chance, in order to differ from the  5% chance  of having/adopting a child when married. Other than this, this is a fantastic game! Thank you and have a good day!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1274434750"}, "name":{"label":"Ironmanlover124"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-24T14:31:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12932271512"}, "title":{"label":"Poor controller support"}, "content":{"label":"Dualsense Controller Issues on iPad– Buttons Not Working Properly\nHello,\nI’m playing Stardew Valley on my iPad 8th (most recent game versions) and using a Dualsense (PlayStation 5) controller, but the experience has been frustrating—almost nothing works correctly.\nHere are the main issues I’ve encountered:\n• I can’t open the journal, no matter which button I press.\n• Selling items doesn’t work correctly—the controls are completely off.\n• The button mapping is wrong and inconsistent, making the controller\nWhen trying to go to Marnie’s ranch or robins shop, when trying to click an option it will glitch and I have to use my finger \nnearly unusable.\nIt would be great if you could fix the controller support on iPad or, even better, add a setting to remap controller buttons so we can adjust them ourselves.\nI’d really appreciate any updates on this, as I love the game and just want a smooth experience with my controller.\nThanks in advance!\n\nCan you guys also add keyboard and mouse support?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
