{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id87452264"}, "name":{"label":"LucasW."}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-18T21:36:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12909226639"}, "title":{"label":"Deleted Progress"}, "content":{"label":"I have always loved Stardew and have recently moved to the phone version. Unfortunately my progress keeps being deleted and it’s sort of discouraging.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1585904956"}, "name":{"label":"åbčðęfğħįjķľmñœpqřßþųvŵxÿž"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-18T17:00:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.0"}, "id":{"label":"12908545848"}, "title":{"label":"One of the greats"}, "content":{"label":"At the beginning, you might not really know what to do. Don’t give up. Forage fruits, cut down trees and make enough money to get a chicken coop. That’s your first step. Once you get going, the game is so fun. There’s plenty to do even if it’s not always obvious what you’re supposed to do. You can mine, fish, grow friendships, farm, forage, go to festivals,buy stuff, explore, etc., etc. etc. A big thing for me is the art. It’s so beautiful. There’s so many secrets and missions to do. Even though I’ve taken many long breaks from Stardew Valley to play other games. I always find myself coming back for more! There are always new secrets, and things to uncover. For example, the bookstore, calico Desert, the town center(don’t sign up for Joja mart! Biggest mistake I ever made!) , the secret words, the summit, the witches hut, Willy’s boat, etc. You will never run out of things to do. I’m on year eight on one farm and still not even close to discovering everything that I would like to. Concerned, ape has created a masterpiece!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
